        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/ecccb3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-02-19T23:45:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Here is the question. Similiar question after.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Omnitron X has Ablative Coating and Reactive Plating Subroutine in play.</p><p>The Dreamer's Granite Oni is in play.</p><p>Oni deals Omnitron 2 melee damage, Omnitron reduces it by 2....now can he dealt 2 melee back to the Oni?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I read that he could since he was dealt damage but I also read that he can't because he took no damage. It doesnt say damage taken so am I doing this right?</p><p>***similar question. If the Whipacorn deals damage but is reduced to 0 is it still damage dealt since he dealt damage?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:51.045Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
