        "raw": "<p>Here is the question. Similiar question after.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Omnitron X has Ablative Coating and Reactive Plating Subroutine in play.</p><p>The Dreamer&#39;s Granite Oni is in play.</p><p>Oni deals Omnitron 2 melee damage, Omnitron reduces it by 2....now can he dealt 2 melee back to the Oni?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I read that he could since he was dealt damage but I also read that he can&#39;t because he took no damage. It doesnt say damage taken so am I doing this right?</p><p>***similar question. If the Whipacorn deals damage but is reduced to 0 is it still damage dealt since he dealt damage?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
